# Everything a keeper build is given (#2651): update.sh exports exactly these
# paths of the commit it deploys, and nothing else, to the build sandbox. So
# two commits whose export of these paths is byte-identical build the same
# bundle, and the updater builds a commit only when its export differs from
# the running release's (build-source.sh). A path the build needs and this
# list leaves out makes the build fail, never pass on stale input.
#
# The root manifests decide what pnpm installs, and with which pnpm.
package.json
pnpm-lock.yaml
pnpm-workspace.yaml
# The keeper and the workspace packages it depends on, devDependencies
# included (`pnpm install --filter '@vaipakam/keeper...'` installs them all).
apps/keeper
packages/anvil-harness
packages/contracts
packages/lib
packages/push
# Indexer modules the keeper bundles by relative import
# (scripts/lib/keeper-databases.mjs reads the private-database list there).
apps/indexer/scripts/lib
